STM32 CAN1 ↔ HS-CAN Transceiver
NUCLEO-F439ZI            TJA1051 #1
------------------------------------

PD1  CAN1_TX -----------> TXD

PD0  CAN1_RX <----------- RXD

5V  --------------------> VCC

GND --------------------> GND


